{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-golden-skew-dual-node-table-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:golden-skew-dual-node-table-data","kind":"table","title":"Golden-ratio bar-involution dual: sub- vs super-classical nodes","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-golden-skew-dual-node"],"tags":["golden-ratio","bar-involution","dual-node"],"text":"golden-skew-dual-node-table-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"tbl:golden-skew-dual-node-table-data\"></a>\n<strong>Table.</strong> <em>Golden-ratio bar-involution dual: sub- vs super-classical nodes</em></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Side</th>\n<th>Node</th>\n<th>Distance from <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>sub-classical</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_{\\mathrm{gold}} = 1/\\varphi^2 \\approx 0.382</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0 - 1/\\varphi^2 \\approx 0.728</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>super-classical</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q^{*}_{\\mathrm{gold}} = \\varphi^2 \\approx 2.618</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\varphi^2 - q_0 \\approx 1.508</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"}
